{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23952","headline":"池上小宴问程秀才 · 白居易","name":"池上小宴问程秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛下林园好自知，江南景物闇相随。\n净淘红粒罯香饭，薄切紫鳞烹水葵。\n雨滴篷声青雀舫，浪摇花影白莲池。\n停杯一问苏州客，何似吴松江上时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}